{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A NEW TAKE ON GOLF\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Charge up your boosters to launch Bogey through a wide world filled with unique platforming challenges. Careful, you\u2019ll need good timing and a keen eye to master these diabolical obstacles.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060990/extras/c918ae9cb2d86053fe57dfa73ced4895.poster.avif?t=1759258303\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060990/extras/c918ae9cb2d86053fe57dfa73ced4895.webm?t=1759258303\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060990/extras/c918ae9cb2d86053fe57dfa73ced4895.mp4?t=1759258303\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPLORE THE WORLD </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple biomes hide both secrets and a wide variety of mechanics for you to play with and master. Revisit old areas with new powers to unlock additional challenges and rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060990/extras/73dcbd446c2f7b57432b223204e585c4.poster.avif?t=1759258303\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060990/extras/73dcbd446c2f7b57432b223204e585c4.webm?t=1759258303\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060990/extras/73dcbd446c2f7b57432b223204e585c4.mp4?t=1759258303\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >UNLOCK NEW ABILITIES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Across the world four different dungeons hide four unique abilities to control Bogey. Slam in a completely different direction off a bounce pad or skip across water with speed.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060990/extras/9ced657503197debe26d9078fb6cd0f4.poster.avif?t=1759258303\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060990/extras/9ced657503197debe26d9078fb6cd0f4.webm?t=1759258303\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060990/extras/9ced657503197debe26d9078fb6cd0f4.mp4?t=1759258303\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STORY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An alien parasite has landed and taken over the Elder Golf Gods. You play as Bogey, a robot golf ball who takes matters into its own hands to save the world. Fight the alien bosses across four dungeons to bring peace back to Albatropolis.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060990/extras/de5d757c0b3b537477bd9e03afdc3fe7.poster.avif?t=1759258303\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060990/extras/de5d757c0b3b537477bd9e03afdc3fe7.webm?t=1759258303\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4060990/extras/de5d757c0b3b537477bd9e03afdc3fe7.mp4?t=1759258303\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4060990?t=1759258303","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4060990?t=1759258303","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_ass